lzug-admin account - Manage operator accounts and one-time credentials.

Bootstrap, invite, disable, recover, or consume one-time account credentials.

Usage:
  lzug-admin [global options] account <action> [options]

Actions:
  bootstrap          Create the first operator account.
  consume-invitation Consume a one-time invitation token.
  consume-recovery   Consume a one-time recovery token.
  disable            Disable an operator account.
  invite             Invite an operator account.
  recover            Issue account recovery credentials.

Global options:
  --engine ENGINE          Container engine: auto, docker, or podman. Values: auto, docker, podman. Default: auto.
  --container NAME         Exact running container name.
  --config FILE            Read this explicit non-secret JSON configuration file.
  --no-config              Do not read a configuration file.
  --json                   Write exactly one machine-readable result object to stdout.
  --verbose                Write additional secret-free diagnostics to stderr.
  --force                  Skip an ordinary destructive-operation prompt.
  --help             Show this help.
